    "body": "Per https://httpwg.org/http-extensions/draft-ietf-httpbis-rfc6265bis.html#name-syntax looks like everything is a SHOULD NOT not a MUST NOT. Given that:\r\n\r\n* Path looks constrained to any U+0020...U+007E except `;`.  So ASCII only.\r\n* Domain similarly looks constrained to ASCII given the notes. \r\n\r\nI guess we could use `ByteString` here?\r\n",
